 "pieces": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 2.553,
   "end": 5.913,
   "text": "Sepsis is a dangerous reaction to infection,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 6.14,
   "end": 7.02,
   "text": "and it moves fast."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 7.4,
   "end": 8.3,
   "text": "Every hour counts."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 8.548,
   "end": 9.768,
   "text": "But hospital alarms"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 10.02,
   "end": 11.16,
   "text": "go off all day,"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 11.553,
   "end": 13.233,
   "text": "so nurses start to tune them out."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 13.533,
   "end": 15.553,
   "text": "This is called alarm fatigue,"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 15.76,
   "end": 16.5,
   "text": "and it can hide"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "section": "hook",
   "start": 16.675,
   "end": 18.215,
   "text": "the one alert that matters."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "section": "what",
   "start": 18.765,
   "end": 22.345,
   "text": "SepsisLens is an early warning model for hospital patients."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "section": "what",
   "start": 22.645,
   "end": 28.085,
   "text": "It spots sepsis risk sooner, and it explains why it raised each alert."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "section": "what",
   "start": 28.385,
   "end": 31.765,
   "text": "We train it on one hospital, then test on another."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 32.315,
   "end": 36.175,
   "text": "This is a real patient from a public ICU dataset."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 36.475,
   "end": 37.555,
   "text": "With the name removed,"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 37.855,
   "end": 40.955,
   "text": "we replay the stay one hour at a time."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 41.255,
   "end": 42.435,
   "text": "The chart only"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 42.71,
   "end": 45.31,
   "text": "shows what the hospital knew at that hour."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "section": "demo",
   "start": 45.61,
   "end": 46.83,
   "text": "Nothing from the future."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "section": "alert",
   "start": 47.73,
   "end": 51.15,
   "text": "At hour 169, the model raises an alert."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "section": "alert",
   "start": 51.45,
   "end": 52.65,
   "text": "Now look at the vitals."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "section": "alert",
   "start": 52.95,
   "end": 54.49,
   "text": "They still look fairly normal."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "section": "alert",
   "start": 54.79,
   "end": 57.85,
   "text": "A person glancing at this chart might not worry yet."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 58.75,
   "end": 61.55,
   "text": "NEWS2 is a common bedside score."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 61.85,
   "end": 64.85,
   "text": "It does not alert until hour 179."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 65.15,
   "end": 66.53,
   "text": "That is 10 hours later."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 66.877,
   "end": 71.237,
   "text": "Our best estimate of when sepsis began is hour 181."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 71.537,
   "end": 74.617,
   "text": "So the model warned about 12 hours ahead,"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "section": "news",
   "start": 74.937,
   "end": 76.837,
   "text": "10 hours before NEWS2."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "section": "why",
   "start": 77.737,
   "end": 78.877,
   "text": "Now the important part."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "section": "why",
   "start": 79.18,
   "end": 79.5,
   "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "section": "why",
   "start": 79.8,
   "end": 82.64,
   "text": "The red bars show what pushed the risk up."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "section": "why",
   "start": 82.94,
   "end": 88.58,
   "text": "Oxygen support, a faster breathing rate, and a kidney blood test called BUN."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "section": "why",
   "start": 88.88,
   "end": 92.36,
   "text": "These are the model's reasons, not proof of cause."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 93.26,
   "end": 95.1,
   "text": "We tested on Hospital B,"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 95.355,
   "end": 97.035,
   "text": "which the model never trained on."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 97.335,
   "end": 100.455,
   "text": "We gave both methods the same alarm budget."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 100.755,
   "end": 101.875,
   "text": "SepsisLens had"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 102.232,
   "end": 104.112,
   "text": "14.1%"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 104.48,
   "end": 105.48,
   "text": "fewer false alarms."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 105.78,
   "end": 109.0,
   "text": "It caught about the same share of septic patients:"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 109.285,
   "end": 111.265,
   "text": "69.0%,"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 111.525,
   "end": 112.265,
   "text": "compared with"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 112.647,
   "end": 114.407,
   "text": "67.0%."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 114.707,
   "end": 116.567,
   "text": "That small gap could be luck,"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 116.847,
   "end": 119.247,
   "text": "so we do not claim a win there."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "section": "results",
   "start": 119.6,
   "end": 124.78,
   "text": "The clearer result is fewer false alarms, which means less noise for nurses."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 125.68,
   "end": 126.84,
   "text": "Here are the limits."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 127.14,
   "end": 130.04,
   "text": "This is old data, not a live hospital,"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 130.34,
   "end": 132.32,
   "text": "and it is not a medical device."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 132.62,
   "end": 135.94,
   "text": "I picked this patient to show an early alert."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 136.24,
   "end": 139.71,
   "text": "With a tighter budget of two alerts per hundred hours,"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 139.952,
   "end": 141.992,
   "text": "NEWS2 catches slightly more."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 142.292,
   "end": 142.912,
   "text": "Next step:"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "section": "limits",
   "start": 143.137,
   "end": 144.677,
   "text": "test it with real clinicians."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "section": "close",
   "start": 145.577,
   "end": 147.257,
   "text": "I am the SepsisLens team."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "section": "close",
   "start": 147.59,
   "end": 148.09,
   "text": "Earlier,"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "section": "close",
   "start": 148.415,
   "end": 151.795,
   "text": "quieter, and explainable alerts, with honest limits."
  }
 ],
